  {
    "id": 1013003050040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "アナタが私のプロデューサーね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101300305/1013003050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、君が有──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003050050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いい？　目指すならトップだけよ！",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300305/1013003050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……え、えーっと？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003050060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "あら、何を呆けているのかしら\r\n当然のことでしょう！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300305/1013003050060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003050070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "アイドルだろうとなんだろうと、\r\n世界一以外の目標はありえないわ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300305/1013003050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003050080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "アナタも私のプロデューサーなら\r\nそのつもりでいなさい！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300305/1013003050080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……わかった。じゃあ、そのために\r\nどうすればいいか、一緒に考えていこう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003050090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いいえ、その必要はないわ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300305/1013003050090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どういうことだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003050100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "アイドルのプロデュースならアナタのほうが\r\n経験があるかもしれないけど",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300305/1013003050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003050110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "有栖川夏葉のプロデュースなら私のほうが\r\n経験が長いというだけの話よ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300305/1013003050110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003050120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "だからアナタは何も考えなくていいの\r\n全部私に任せておきなさい",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300305/1013003050120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん……さすがにそういうわけにもいかないけど、\r\n君の意見はできるだけ取り入れていくことにしよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
